# Models

## What Exists

### Core
- `User` - Devise-authenticated user model

## Conventions

- Fat models, skinny controllers
- Use concerns for shared behavior
- Use scopes for common queries
- Use `broadcasts_refreshes` for real-time updates via Turbo
- Validate at the model level, not the controller level

